  "description": "Maximum power through the mountains. That’s what the HAIBIKE ALLMTN CF 9 delivers – down to the last bolt. A sporty eMTB that impresses with peak all-mountain performance and clever engineering. To get the most out of the powerful Bosch Performance CX drive system, we’ve mounted the motor inverted inside the carbon frame. This allows for improved heat management and greater efficiency when your rides get serious. A purpose-built kinematic system with a horizontal shock, together with the mullet wheel mix and the 160mm RockShox fork, turns rough downhill sections into smooth forest trails. The 800Wh battery offers lasting power and can be extended by 250Wh with an optional range extender. Grippy SRAM DB8 disc brakes round off this strong all-mountain setup. Perfect conditions for alpine adventures with maximum power.",
